{
  "id": "class10-science/ch12/series-or-parallel",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "title": {
    "en": "Series or parallel?",
    "hi": "श्रेणी या पार्श्व?"
  },
  "concepts": ["series-circuits", "parallel-circuits"],
  "boards": [
    {
      "name": "series",
      "root": {
        "name": "page",
        "kind": "column",
        "children": [
          {
            "name": "title",
            "kind": "prop",
            "prop": "text",
            "with": {
              "style": "title",
              "text": {
                "en": "Two bulbs in a row (in series). Take one out. What happens to the other?",
                "hi": "दो बल्ब एक के बाद एक (श्रेणी में)। एक बल्ब निकालो। दूसरे का क्या होता है?"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "circuit",
            "kind": "prop",
            "prop": "circuit",
            "with": {
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "id": "a",
                  "x": 1,
                  "y": 7
                },
                {
                  "id": "b",
                  "x": 1,
                  "y": 1
                },
                {
                  "id": "c",
                  "x": 5,
                  "y": 1
                },
                {
                  "id": "d",
                  "x": 9,
                  "y": 1
                },
                {
                  "id": "e",
                  "x": 9,
                  "y": 7
                },
                {
                  "id": "f",
                  "x": 5,
                  "y": 7
                }
              ],
              "components": [
                {
                  "id": "cell",
                  "kind": "cell",
                  "from": "a",
                  "to": "b",
                  "volts": 1.5
                },
                {
                  "id": "bulbA",
                  "kind": "bulb",
                  "from": "b",
                  "to": "c",
                  "ohms": 5,
                  "label": {
                    "en": "A",
                    "hi": "A"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "bulbB",
                  "kind": "bulb",
                  "from": "c",
                  "to": "d",
                  "ohms": 5,
                  "label": {
                    "en": "B",
                    "hi": "B"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "right",
                  "kind": "wire",
                  "from": "d",
                  "to": "e"
                },
                {
                  "id": "key",
                  "kind": "switch",
                  "from": "e",
                  "to": "f",
                  "isClosed": true
                },
                {
                  "id": "bottom",
                  "kind": "wire",
                  "from": "f",
                  "to": "a"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "volts",
            "kind": "prop",
            "prop": "text",
            "with": {
              "style": "note",
              "text": {
                "en": "…",
                "hi": "…"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "mayaSeries",
            "kind": "prop",
            "isHidden": true,
            "prop": "line",
            "with": {
              "character": "maya",
              "line": {
                "en": "Both went dark. In series there is only one path for the current. Break it anywhere and everything stops. And see how dim they were: they shared the cell's push.",
                "hi": "दोनों बुझ गए। श्रेणी में धारा के लिए एक ही रास्ता है। कहीं भी तोड़ो, सब रुक जाता है। और देखो वे कितने धीमे जल रहे थे: दोनों ने सेल का धक्का बाँट लिया था।"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "rest",
            "kind": "space"
          }
        ]
      },
      "is": [
        {
          "set": "volts.text",
          "text": {
            "en": "Bulb A: {fixed(circuit.voltage.bulbA, 2)} V · Bulb B: {fixed(circuit.voltage.bulbB, 2)} V",
            "hi": "बल्ब A: {fixed(circuit.voltage.bulbA, 2)} V · बल्ब B: {fixed(circuit.voltage.bulbB, 2)} V"
          }
        }
      ],
      "when": [
        {
          "on": "board.started",
          "do": {
            "call": "title.say"
          }
        },
        {
          "on": "circuit.bulbTakenOut",
          "do": [
            {
              "call": "board.show",
              "args": {
                "name": "mayaSeries"
              }
            },
            {
              "call": "mayaSeries.say"
            },
            {
              "call": "board.pass"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "studentOnly": ["circuit.takeOutBulb"]
    },
    {
      "name": "parallel",
      "root": {
        "name": "page",
        "kind": "column",
        "children": [
          {
            "name": "title",
            "kind": "prop",
            "prop": "text",
            "with": {
              "style": "title",
              "text": {
                "en": "Now side by side (in parallel). Take one out again.",
                "hi": "अब अगल-बगल (पार्श्व में)। फिर से एक बल्ब निकालो।"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "circuit",
            "kind": "prop",
            "prop": "circuit",
            "with": {
              "nodes": [
                {
                  "id": "a",
                  "x": 1,
                  "y": 7
                },
                {
                  "id": "b",
                  "x": 1,
                  "y": 1
                },
                {
                  "id": "c",
                  "x": 5,
                  "y": 1
                },
                {
                  "id": "d",
                  "x": 9,
                  "y": 1
                },
                {
                  "id": "e",
                  "x": 9,
                  "y": 7
                },
                {
                  "id": "f",
                  "x": 5,
                  "y": 7
                },
                {
                  "id": "g",
                  "x": 3,
                  "y": 7
                }
              ],
              "components": [
                {
                  "id": "cell",
                  "kind": "cell",
                  "from": "a",
                  "to": "b",
                  "volts": 1.5
                },
                {
                  "id": "topLeft",
                  "kind": "wire",
                  "from": "b",
                  "to": "c"
                },
                {
                  "id": "topRight",
                  "kind": "wire",
                  "from": "c",
                  "to": "d"
                },
                {
                  "id": "bulbA",
                  "kind": "bulb",
                  "from": "c",
                  "to": "f",
                  "ohms": 5,
                  "label": {
                    "en": "A",
                    "hi": "A"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "bulbB",
                  "kind": "bulb",
                  "from": "d",
                  "to": "e",
                  "ohms": 5,
                  "label": {
                    "en": "B",
                    "hi": "B"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "bottomRight",
                  "kind": "wire",
                  "from": "e",
                  "to": "f"
                },
                {
                  "id": "key",
                  "kind": "switch",
                  "from": "f",
                  "to": "g",
                  "isClosed": true
                },
                {
                  "id": "bottomLeft",
                  "kind": "wire",
                  "from": "g",
                  "to": "a"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "volts",
            "kind": "prop",
            "prop": "text",
            "with": {
              "style": "note",
              "text": {
                "en": "…",
                "hi": "…"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "arjunParallel",
            "kind": "prop",
            "isHidden": true,
            "prop": "line",
            "with": {
              "character": "arjun",
              "line": {
                "en": "The other one stays lit! Each bulb has its own path to the cell, and each gets the full 1.5 volts, so they are brighter too.",
                "hi": "दूसरा जलता रहा! हर बल्ब का सेल तक अपना रास्ता है, और हर एक को पूरे 1.5 वोल्ट मिलते हैं, इसलिए वे ज़्यादा चमकते भी हैं।"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "rest",
            "kind": "space"
          }
        ]
      },
      "is": [
        {
          "set": "volts.text",
          "text": {
            "en": "Bulb A: {fixed(circuit.voltage.bulbA, 2)} V · Bulb B: {fixed(circuit.voltage.bulbB, 2)} V",
            "hi": "बल्ब A: {fixed(circuit.voltage.bulbA, 2)} V · बल्ब B: {fixed(circuit.voltage.bulbB, 2)} V"
          }
        }
      ],
      "when": [
        {
          "on": "board.started",
          "do": {
            "call": "title.say"
          }
        },
        {
          "on": "circuit.bulbTakenOut",
          "do": [
            {
              "call": "board.show",
              "args": {
                "name": "arjunParallel"
              }
            },
            {
              "call": "arjunParallel.say"
            },
            {
              "call": "board.pass"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "studentOnly": ["circuit.takeOutBulb"]
    },
    {
      "name": "check",
      "root": {
        "name": "page",
        "kind": "column",
        "children": [
          {
            "name": "houseWiring",
            "kind": "prop",
            "prop": "choice",
            "with": {
              "prompt": {
                "en": "At home, when one bulb fuses, the fan and the other lights keep working. So the house is wired…",
                "hi": "घर में जब एक बल्ब फ्यूज़ हो जाता है, तो पंखा और बाकी बत्तियाँ चलती रहती हैं। तो घर की वायरिंग है…"
              },
              "options": [
                {
                  "id": "series",
                  "label": {
                    "en": "in series",
                    "hi": "श्रेणी में"
                  },
                  "feedback": {
                    "en": "In series, one fused bulb would break the only path and switch everything off.",
                    "hi": "श्रेणी में एक फ्यूज़ बल्ब इकलौता रास्ता तोड़ देता और सब बंद हो जाता।"
                  },
                  "misconception": "seriesKeepsOthersOn"
                },
                {
                  "id": "parallel",
                  "label": {
                    "en": "in parallel",
                    "hi": "पार्श्व में"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "eitherWay",
                  "label": {
                    "en": "either way, it makes no difference",
                    "hi": "किसी भी तरह, कोई फ़र्क नहीं पड़ता"
                  },
                  "feedback": {
                    "en": "It does matter: you saw the series bulbs go dark together, and the parallel one stay on.",
                    "hi": "फ़र्क पड़ता है: तुमने देखा कि श्रेणी वाले बल्ब साथ बुझे, और पार्श्व वाला जलता रहा।"
                  },
                  "misconception": "wiringDoesNotMatter"
                }
              ],
              "answer": "parallel",
              "concepts": ["parallel-circuits"]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "rest",
            "kind": "space"
          }
        ]
      },
      "is": [],
      "when": [
        {
          "on": "board.started",
          "do": {
            "call": "houseWiring.say"
          }
        },
        {
          "on": "houseWiring.correct",
          "do": {
            "call": "board.pass"
          }
        }
      ],
      "studentOnly": []
    }
  ]
}
